  "body": "The owner is highly motivated to sell. Opportunities of this calibre are rare - early viewing is strongly recommended.\r\n\r\nPanoramic views across the Hauraki Gulf, the city skyline and out to the Waitakere Ranges set the stage for this exceptional multi-level residence - a home where scale, versatility and breathtaking outlooks come together in perfect harmony.\r\n\r\nWith six bedrooms and four bathrooms, this substantial property offers outstanding flexibility for extended families, guests, or multi-generational living. High end finishes and an inviting open plan design create a warm, graceful atmosphere, enhanced by all day sunlight and seamless indoor-outdoor flow.\r\n\r\nEntry Level\r\nThe ground floor is ideal for independent living or guest accommodation, featuring:\r\n*             Two generous bedrooms, each with its own ensuite\r\n*             A comfortable lounge\r\n*             A large double garage with an adjoining workshop area\r\n\r\nMiddle Level\r\nUpstairs, the heart of the home unfolds:\r\n*             A separate kitchen and dining area\r\n*             A spacious lounge plus formal dining, complete with a gas fire and balcony\r\n*             Three additional bedrooms and a well appointed bathroom\r\nA central living zone anchors this level, creating a welcoming, open environment perfect for family connection and entertaining.\r\n\r\nOutdoor Living\r\nThe outdoor spaces are truly spectacular. Multiple seating areas surround the pool, offering endless options for summer gatherings. The northerly aspect ensures all day sun, making this an idyllic setting to relax, entertain, and enjoy the best of coastal living.\r\n\r\nMaster Retreat\r\nThe top level is dedicated entirely to an outstanding master suite, complete with:\r\n*             A luxurious walk in wardrobe\r\n*             A private ensuite\r\n*             270 degree views that elevate everyday living into something extraordinary\r\n\r\nClose to Milford Shops, the Beach (Milford and Castor Bay both within walking distance) this home has everything you need at your fingertips. Westlake Girls and Boys High Schools, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Campbells Bay Primary School zones.",
